    "detailed_description": "Everything you need to do is very simple \u2013 just race and over take every other car on the track to win the race! Quick Race is a simple racing game where you can compete with AI or on a split screen with your friend. <br>Main features included in the game:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 tracks with different shapes and surfaces<br></li><li> ability to change time of the day<br></li><li> ability to change AI difficulty<br></li><li> different types of cars <br></li><li> split screen<br></li><li> changeable amount of laps<br></li><li> simple steering</li></ul><br>Quick Race is definitely not the simulation game but the steering is made to imitate as much as possible the real steering. Remember to be a nice driver to the other cars. Otherwise they won\u2019t be nice to you causing you to end a race on a wall or out of the track. So, what are you waiting for? Grab the key and put it into your racer\u2019signition!",
    "about_the_game": "Everything you need to do is very simple \u2013 just race and over take every other car on the track to win the race! Quick Race is a simple racing game where you can compete with AI or on a split screen with your friend. <br>Main features included in the game:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 tracks with different shapes and surfaces<br></li><li> ability to change time of the day<br></li><li> ability to change AI difficulty<br></li><li> different types of cars <br></li><li> split screen<br></li><li> changeable amount of laps<br></li><li> simple steering</li></ul><br>Quick Race is definitely not the simulation game but the steering is made to imitate as much as possible the real steering. Remember to be a nice driver to the other cars. Otherwise they won\u2019t be nice to you causing you to end a race on a wall or out of the track. So, what are you waiting for? Grab the key and put it into your racer\u2019signition!",
    "short_description": "Everything you need to do is very simple \u2013 just race and over take every other car on the track to win the race! Quick Race is a simple racing game where you can compete with AI or on a split screen with your friend.",
